  "audio_segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 10.44,
      "text": "A few years ago, I felt like I was stuck in a rut, so I decided to follow in the footsteps",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12288561194057925,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004795859567821026
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 2,
      "start": 10.44,
      "end": 17.24,
      "text": "of the great American philosopher, Morgan Spurlock, and try something new for 30 days.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12288561194057925,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004795859567821026
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 3,
      "start": 17.24,
      "end": 19.52,
      "text": "The idea is actually pretty simple.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12288561194057925,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004795859567821026
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 4,
      "start": 19.52,
      "end": 23.8,
      "text": "Think about something you've always wanted to add to your life, and try it for the",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12288561194057925,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004795859567821026
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 5,
      "start": 23.8,
      "end": 25.64,
      "text": "next 30 days.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12288561194057925,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004795859567821026
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 6,
      "start": 25.64,
      "end": 31.12,
      "text": "It turns out, 30 days is just about the right amount of time to add a new habit or subtract",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11488502426485045,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0012838877737522125
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 7,
      "start": 31.12,
      "end": 34.72,
      "text": "a habit, like watching the news from your life.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11488502426485045,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0012838877737522125
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 8,
      "start": 34.72,
      "end": 38.32,
      "text": "There's a few things that I learned while doing these 30 day challenges.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11488502426485045,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0012838877737522125
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 9,
      "start": 38.32,
      "end": 45.88,
      "text": "The first was, instead of the months flying by forgotten, the time was much more memorable.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11488502426485045,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0012838877737522125
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 10,
      "start": 45.88,
      "end": 49.88,
      "text": "This was part of a challenge I did to take a picture every day for a month, and I remember",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11488502426485045,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0012838877737522125
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 11,
      "start": 49.88,
      "end": 54.76,
      "text": "exactly where I was and what I was doing that day.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11488502426485045,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0012838877737522125
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 12,
      "start": 54.76,
      "end": 60.12,
      "text": "I also noticed that as I started to do more and harder 30 day challenges, myself confident.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.19653356820344925,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.041760653257369995
    }
  ],
